{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cGirl of the Ruins\u201d is a horror-mystery adventure game set in the future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a girl who looks exactly like you appears and suddenly asks to swap bodies for a few days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swayed by her sweet promise of salvation, you impulsively agree to her proposal...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what awaits you after this\u2014will it be a sweet salvation, or a horrifying truth and memories you wish you could forget?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039560/extras/ef941bd9266223c5c635324d61cbf83c.avif?t=1761453646\" width=558 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a demo version that allows you to experience the first part of the game, with a playtime of approximately under one hour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player game supporting Korean subtitles and interface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the game with puzzles and mini-games of moderate difficulty, as well as unique quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure game based on RPG Maker; explore new locations and gather clues and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with various NPCs and gradually uncover the mysterious truths that unfold.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039560?t=1761453646","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039560?t=1761453646","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039560/bc362e2bb0c614ccc5a427e6704dd1385509f7e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761453646","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039560/bc362e2bb0c614ccc5a427e6704dd1385509f7e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761453646","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cGirl of the Ruins\u201d is a horror-mystery adventure game set in the future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a girl who looks exactly like you appears and suddenly asks to swap bodies for a few days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swayed by her sweet promise of salvation, you impulsively agree to her proposal...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what awaits you after this\u2014will it be a sweet salvation, or a horrifying truth and memories you wish you could forget?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039560/extras/ef941bd9266223c5c635324d61cbf83c.avif?t=1761453646\" width=558 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a demo version that allows you to experience the first part of the game, with a playtime of approximately under one hour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player game supporting Korean subtitles and interface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the game with puzzles and mini-games of moderate difficulty, as well as unique quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure game based on RPG Maker; explore new locations and gather clues and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with various NPCs and gradually uncover the mysterious truths that unfold.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Fireworks"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4039450","name":"Girl of the Ruins"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039560/1bfd8d3d0960d3beed70316040d76339c2601d28/header.jpg?t=1761453646","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Girl of the Ruins Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8 / 8.1 / 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any processor @ 2.0 GHz (or over Intel Core i3)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU supporting OpenGL<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Fireworks"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nAtos criminosos","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nAlkohol / Tabak","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039560/daa33bb7bd362c570844da89d5c1cee0f85c7365/ss_daa33bb7bd362c570844da89d5c1cee0f85c7365.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761453646","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039560/daa33bb7bd362c570844da89d5c1cee0f85c7365/ss_daa33bb7bd362c570844da89d5c1cee0f85c7365.600x338.jpg?t=1761453646"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039560/7e456b6da711f5c51727ff6081242c9bccf88342/ss_